Coverage: game wrappers serve FINISHED games only (an unfinished game raises \code{hoopR_asset_fetch}). The box score,
summary, score line, statistics and leaders answer for every season from 1993-94 (before 2024-25 the scoring splits
and lead statistics are 0). Play-by-play and shots exist from 2024-25 only; an earlier finished game raises
\code{hoopR_no_data}. From 2016-17 the results season id is also the Genius LiveStats competition id (see the \code{genius}
family) which holds play-by-play for older games; lkl.lt game, team and player ids are lkl.lt's own and do not join
Genius ids. The King Mindaugas Cup shares the routes but is not wrapped. Text fields are Lithuanian.

Errors: \code{hoopR_no_data} when lkl.lt has nothing for the request (HTTP 404, an unknown game or standings season, a
season the site's selects do not list, a season without played games, a finished game before 2024-25 asked for
play-by-play or shots); \code{hoopR_bad_request} for a game id or season that is not an integer, or HTTP 400 / 422;
\code{hoopR_asset_fetch} when the fetch failed or the answer is not the one asked for (an unfinished game, a body or page
for another game or season, an error or changed body, a truncated results list). All inherit \code{hoopR_error}. Dates
and times are Lithuanian local (Europe/Vilnius) as the site prints them.
